  "description": "A contract-driven, Native AOT-ready .NET 10 SDK for Solana — independently implemented from pinned Anza Solana SDK, Agave, and SPL source contracts. Source-generated JSON with no reflection; typed RPC and multiplexed WebSocket streaming; Ed25519 and BLS12-381 keys/signatures; program instructions and bounded state decoding; and exact legacy/v0/V1 transaction wire formats verified against Rust-compatible vectors. Ships as one package bundling the Core, Wallet, Rpc, and Programs functional assemblies plus a minimal packaging facade.",
