  "readmeFile": "README.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.1.0 — correctness, hardening, and performance. Fixes Token-2022 CreateNativeMint, which named the classic wSOL mint and could never succeed, and the SlotHashes/StakeHistory decoders, which rejected the canonical zero-padded sysvar account on any cluster whose 512-entry ring was not yet full. PublicKey.IsOnCurve is 39x faster (309us -> 7.8us), taking PDA/ATA derivation from 642us to 18us; 32-byte base58 encode and PublicKey/Hash parsing use a fixed-width codec (parse 1.18us -> 0.25us, allocation-free). Base58 parsing is length-bounded before decoding, so a hostile 200,000-character string is rejected immediately instead of costing ~24s. Adds Mints.Token2022NativeMint, MaxBase58Length constants, and length-bounded Base58 overloads. WebSocket subscriptions gained configurable wire-byte budgets. Wire output is unchanged and verified byte-for-byte against the pinned Rust sources. Full details: https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp/blob/v3.1.0/CHANGELOG.md",
